# Per-instance directories — each operator's `jackpot init` output
# lives here. Per design Decision 1: everything is gitignored EXCEPT
# `instances/ci/` (Critical Rule 56 — synthetic-only values, used as
# the canonical CI fixture).
#
# Operators reproducing CI locally use `--instance-name ci-local`
# (gitignored) rather than overwriting the committed `instances/ci/`.

*
!.gitignore
!ci/
!ci/**
